    "detailed_description": "PARASiTE FLOWER is a beautiful yet disturbing side scroller game where you slowly uncover the story of Ari.<br />\r\nA short disturbing horror game where you're playing as Ari Yeong, she is re-living the same day over and over again. With each loop the world around her get's darker and more dangerous. Choose the right options to keep her alive and get her to class.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is interactive, with cut scenes, original watercolor-like artwork. You can enjoy the beautifully drawn scenery, although in contrast will have to go through the dark reality of Ari's life. Keep in mind your decisions matter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCONTROLS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArrow keys to Move<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSPACE to Interact<br />\r\n<br />\r\nF4 for Full-screen<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBUGS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSometimes when it's playing a video the screen will freeze, as of now all I can tell you to close and re-open the game when that happens.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nINSPIRATION<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is inspired by true crime cases and some of my own experiences in Korea, the dark side of Korea.",
